interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7448990Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7463302Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7569622Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7579926Z ^[[0m
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7580692Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7581536Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7581960Z 
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7582548Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7583464Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7584015Z 
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7584445Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7585168Z    if you are ready to continue.
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7585525Z 
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7586550Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7587525Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7588331Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7589052Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7589579Z 
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7589933Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7590393Z 
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7590757Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7591209Z    can use Nix.
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7591404Z 
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7591521Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7591728Z 
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7592319Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7592860Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7596103Z 
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7596317Z I will:
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7596691Z 
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7597082Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7597896Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7598655Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7599348Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7599873Z  - install Nix in /nix
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7600386Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7601107Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7601773Z    /root
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7613313Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7614223Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7625819Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7626634Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7626936Z 
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7627959Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7628617Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
