interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7648067Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
interactive (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:20.7658736Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
