conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4745591Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4823220Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4831888Z ^[[0m
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4832194Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4832535Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4832729Z 
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4832906Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4833352Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4833724Z 
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4833925Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4834276Z    if you are ready to continue.
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4834440Z 
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4835130Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4835605Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4836174Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4836485Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4836787Z 
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4836955Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4837173Z 
conformance-update (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:38.4837315Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
