check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7984757Z ^[[0m
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7985222Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7985644Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7985818Z 
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7985953Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7986455Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7986737Z 
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7986930Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7987335Z    if you are ready to continue.
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7987547Z 
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7988326Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
