check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7989368Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7989731Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7990064Z 
check (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:48:50.7990281Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
